Explanation: SuperMox builds win over every repository: our own packages
  come from a plain file or directory source, whose apt origin is the empty
  string. apt's preferences parser only continues a record on indented lines,
  so every Explanation line after the first must start with a space.
Package: *
Pin: origin ""
Pin-Priority: 999

